  "narration": [
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-1",
      "transcript": "This burned scroll was too fragile to open. Scientists read it anyway.",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 4.975,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.3c273fd03490e0ada10844abb37a424e769d533f3f7c02bee0cc89dc5d4f33c4",
        "sha256": "3c273fd03490e0ada10844abb37a424e769d533f3f7c02bee0cc89dc5d4f33c4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-2",
      "transcript": "The En-Gedi scroll crumbled when it was touched.",
      "start": 5.366666666666666,
      "duration": 3.025,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.2b33d2a25e8f758f3e66e6f8c5dff3b563cf2f775d8ea0f422fc4486d8ca7923",
        "sha256": "2b33d2a25e8f758f3e66e6f8c5dff3b563cf2f775d8ea0f422fc4486d8ca7923"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-3",
      "transcript": "Researchers scanned it with X-rays, building a three-dimensional map.",
      "start": 8.6,
      "duration": 4.5,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.ca8b12353363e3f98dd88b5f4281bd119ea5828ae7e517671825618ebeae7999",
        "sha256": "ca8b12353363e3f98dd88b5f4281bd119ea5828ae7e517671825618ebeae7999"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-4",
      "transcript": "Inside that scan, they traced the surviving layers.",
      "start": 13.3,
      "duration": 3.65,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.ad6e1558123d9f368db25f307e3b00db52d53d8f3260aad24cf632a29a8f33bf",
        "sha256": "ad6e1558123d9f368db25f307e3b00db52d53d8f3260aad24cf632a29a8f33bf"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-5",
      "transcript": "In this scroll, the ink showed up more densely than the parchment.",
      "start": 17.166666666666668,
      "duration": 4.15,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.b277f65db47d9b9fbd6b67942f1255b34a9327bd2fbbeaa27c63a3ac4f307278",
        "sha256": "b277f65db47d9b9fbd6b67942f1255b34a9327bd2fbbeaa27c63a3ac4f307278"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-6",
      "transcript": "They mapped that signal onto digital surfaces, then flattened them into readable images.",
      "start": 21.533333333333335,
      "duration": 5.775,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.badf31157ec364d0f3cfa3feb4b70f23ffdea55f9fbd412fcd9138e45cdec38f",
        "sha256": "badf31157ec364d0f3cfa3feb4b70f23ffdea55f9fbd412fcd9138e45cdec38f"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-7",
      "transcript": "The recovered Hebrew text came from the Book of Leviticus.",
      "start": 27.7,
      "duration": 3.85,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.248f3af73e4076a4ca330317b95428b8277d9667d67720a706947a8e2a3683ed",
        "sha256": "248f3af73e4076a4ca330317b95428b8277d9667d67720a706947a8e2a3683ed"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-8",
      "transcript": "This worked because the ink was detectable in the scan. Different materials need different approaches.",
      "start": 31.766666666666666,
      "duration": 6.625,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.d4ae1cf1f05c434a55f9d9db80b6508c8503164dd7d6005d652f82fa3338e5b7",
        "sha256": "d4ae1cf1f05c434a55f9d9db80b6508c8503164dd7d6005d652f82fa3338e5b7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scroll-cue-9",
      "transcript": "They revealed surviving writing without unrolling the fragile original.",
      "start": 38.6,
      "duration": 4.95,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.337ef06ce0ddc061ad1eb2549c81a2697aa1771db73fb21816e94caff1fce278",
        "sha256": "337ef06ce0ddc061ad1eb2549c81a2697aa1771db73fb21816e94caff1fce278"
      }
    }
